  "prefLabel": "Rev 2208.04 Cost of the Bonds",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2208.04 Cost of the Bonds.\n\n(a) The cost of the bond shall be paid by the county, pursuant to RSA 27:4.\n\n(b) The cost of the bonds shall be appropriated annually whether the undertaking is issued for a one-year period or a multiple-year period of coverage.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14 (from Rev 2209.04); ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
